{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-16","kind":"proposition","title":"四直线为断比例即首尾两线矩内直角形与中两线矩内直角形等首尾两线与中两线两矩…","englishTitle":"If four straight lines be proportional, the rectangle contained by the extremes is equal to the rectangle contained by the means; and, if the rectangle contained by the extremes be equal to the rectangle contained by the means, the four straight lines will be proportional.","book":6,"number":16,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.16","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.16/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":16,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","contentId":"euclid-6-16","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8cbf9036b3cf055558315534dfc460ef7bd82138c2117aab1130f36ca70572b6","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-16.statement","euclid-6-16.construction.1","euclid-6-16.construction.2","euclid-6-16.construction.3","euclid-6-16.proof.1","euclid-6-16.proof.2","euclid-6-16.proof.3","euclid-6-16.proof.4","euclid-6-16.proof.5","euclid-6-16.proof.6","euclid-6-16.proof.7","euclid-6-16.proof.8","euclid-6-16.proof.9","euclid-6-16.proof.10","euclid-6-16.conclusion","euclid-6-16.historical.1","euclid-6-16.historical.2","euclid-6-16.historical.3","euclid-6-16.historical.4","euclid-6-16.historical.5","euclid-6-16.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-16.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c124459b2652237d18bc5ba1236c72d555a70206ad35e4e40af9e41449b03f76","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If four straight lines be proportional, the rectangle contained by the extremes is equal to the rectangle contained by the means; and, if the rectangle contained by the extremes be equal to the rectangle contained by the means, the four straight lines will be proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果四条直线为成比例, 由极端构成的矩形等于由手段构成的矩形;如果由极端构成的矩形等于手段构成的矩形, 则四条直线为成比例。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"四直线为断比例即首尾两线矩内直角形与中两线矩内直角形等首尾两线与中两线两矩内直角形等即四线为断比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"四条直线是线段比例，即第一条和最后两条线通过矩形内的部分分割，中间两条线在矩形内也相等，中间两条线在线段比例中相等"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ac458c7169b55d46da69b64bf24d872fa2ac4e45e5c1ca2b4892c779fb9222f0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the four straight lines AB, CD, E, F be proportional, so that, as AB is to CD, so is E to F; I say that the rectangle contained by AB, F is equal to the rectangle contained by CD, E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让这4条直线AB,CD,E,F为成比例,这样,AB对CD的比等于E对F的比;我说,AB对F形成的矩形等于CD对E对E的比；AB 与 CD 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0fb671c991084b8a40202cf1ac2e66985430b13301a62156513c865ec68cc70d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AG, CH be drawn from the points A, C at right angles to the straight lines AB, CD, and let AG be made equal to F, and CH equal to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG,CH 从A点,C点,直角点到AB,CD线,AG点等于F,CH点等于E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6bd9be7a4784877499b8f2c477349c391f23df8023a96d39120af3fe0a34972d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the parallelograms BG, DH be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"完成平行四边形 BG DH"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0582ba2de371ceb5c4cd9515368d2465321f548d23a180a9a6333cae6de9a9ba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then since, as AB is to CD, so is E to F, while E is equal to CH, and F to AG, therefore, as AB is to CD, so is CH to AG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB对CD的比等于E对F,E等于CH,F对AG,AB对AB,AB对CD等于CH对AG；AB 与 CD 之比等于 E 与 F 之比；AB 与 CD 之比等于 CH 与 AG 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8859c97377eb8490f0df67a9f1a234e8b833567a3e16a458ab5e28f2692bfbca","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the parallelograms BG, DH the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在平行四边形 BG DH 中,关于平等角度的两边是对等的成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bd131ff3abb880e95c37a647654022483ff6a38ee025132aa021a69788e46512","citations":["euclid-6-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But those equiangular parallelograms in which the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional are equal; [[VI. 14](/principles/euclid-6-14)] therefore the parallelogram BG is equal to the parallelogram DH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,在对等角度成比例的平行四边形方形中,对等角度平行四边形是相等的;因此,平行四边形-BG等于平行四边形-DH。 [[VI. 14](/principles/euclid-6-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"38767858feb21b4af235170da61c927768600d050c5ca5890a4a8ae0290fb947","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And BG is the rectangle AB, F, for AG is equal to F; and DH is the rectangle CD, E, for E is equal to CH; therefore the rectangle contained by AB, F is equal to the rectangle contained by CD, E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BG是矩形 AB,F,AG等于F;DH是矩形 CD,E等于CH;因此,AB,F组成的矩形等于CD,E组成的矩形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"82a87cc3312e6d811846dbdb01c5e81171da63e332ae8d781ea8f8eaf02eab02","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let the rectangle contained by AB, F be equal to the rectangle contained by CD, E; I say that the four straight lines will be proportional, so that, as AB is to CD, so is E to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,AB和F的矩形比CD和E等于矩形比CD;我说,4条直线将是成比例,因此,AB对CD的比等于E对F的比；AB 与 CD 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f40fcd6b9cb9972bf068225a345f12ba201ab0541cb42beaa1f614af3315de0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction, since the rectangle AB, F is equal to the rectangle CD, E, and the rectangle AB, F is BG, for AG is equal to F, and the rectangle CD, E is DH, for CH is equal to E, therefore BG is equal to DH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在同一建筑中,矩形 AB,F等于矩形 CD,E,矩形,F等于BG,AG等于F,矩形,CD,DH,CH等于E,BG等于DH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f0c226dfc632824c589492dcda7c4879986f92ad90a23f70a3e9b52dfcc841e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are equiangular"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"它们是平面的"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"28253bf0965996bfd65844e29d14a8413e93d60f49c6ce84fcdcb184e4e58ed2","citations":["euclid-6-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But in equal and equiangular parallelograms the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional. [[VI. 14](/principles/euclid-6-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是在平等而平面的平行四边形中 平等角度的两面是成比例对等的 [[VI. 14](/principles/euclid-6-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"26cb17398efc4b851996b612a17a652e1b5ab32208a1f74fa85d17be9f0ece9b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as AB is to CD, so is CH to AG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB比CD等于CH比AG；AB 与 CD 之比等于 CH 与 AG 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4568121bba01a8bf9bdba84ca2ca3373f71396d3d14632757463f4d33d94d3a4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CH is equal to E, and AG to F; therefore, as AB is to CD, so is E to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CH等于E,AG至F;因此,AB至CD的比等于E至F的比；AB 与 CD 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"154c7187dabf34118faffbf559378ca4235f866e2fe8eaba93a36fadaebf76f7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"四直线为断比例即首尾两线矩内直角形与中两线矩内直角形等首尾两线与中两线两矩内直角形等即四线为断比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"四条直线是线段比例，即第一条和最后两条线通过矩形内的部分分割，中间两条线在矩形内也相等，中间两条线在线段比例中相等"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"03a3d6313c2791670026fa3d2a4788ccc4bf5a4428666bdcac71681efe0c43c8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先解曰：甲乙己庚戊己乙丙四直线为断比例者谓甲乙与己庚若戊己与乙丙也而甲乙丙丁为甲乙乙丙首尾两线矩内直角形戊己庚辛为戊己己庚中两线矩内直角形题言甲丙戊庚两形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先，说明如下：甲乙己庚戊己乙丙 四条直线按比例分割，意味着 甲乙 与 己庚 是 戊己 与 乙丙，且 甲乙丙丁 是 甲乙乙丙。戊己庚辛 是 戊己己庚 中两条线段矩形内部的部分。命题说明：甲丙戊庚：两个形状，相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":17,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"08a594df9eb9f6551d088c9eccbefff5c9b88221412170fc070bed40dba35a95","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：两形之乙与己既等为直角而甲乙与己庚之比例若戊己与乙丙是乙己等角旁之各两边互相视而甲丙戊庚两直角形必等〈本篇十四〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：由于两个形状 乙 与 己 相等且为直角，甲乙 与 己庚 的比例是 戊己 与 乙丙，则 与 乙丙 角相等，乙己 的两边被认为相互相等，而两个矩形 甲丙戊庚 必须相等 〈本篇十四〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":18,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87f5bd1ba8fd7a3061fc0865e8def7e1cd09b282bffec45696033a093c0fb340","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"后解曰：甲丙戊庚两直角形等题言四线之比例等者谓甲乙与己庚若戊己与乙丙也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲丙戊庚：两个矩形全等比例的命题意味着四条线的比例相等。如果 甲乙 与 己庚 与 戊己 与 乙丙 相同,"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":19,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"44aa6835366424aabe5438579504fafc7df2a7f38d4f7b1d6cdea31031db3eb3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲丙戊庚两形之乙与己既等为直角即等角旁之各两边互相视而甲乙与己庚之比例若戊己与乙丙也〈本篇十四〉则四线为断比例矣注曰若平行斜方形而等角亦同此论如上图以上二题即算家句股法三数算法所赖也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲丙戊庚、乙 和 己 都是直角，这意味着相等角度旁边的两条边是相互看的。如果 甲乙 与 己庚 的比像 戊己 与 乙丙，那么 〈本篇十四〉 就是分割比。注意：如果具有相等角的平行正交形相同，此论证如上图所示。以上两个问题是数学家所依赖的计算、句法方法和三数计算。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-16.source","contentId":"euclid-6-16","revisionId":"euclid-6-16@raw-8cbf9036b3cf0555","order":20,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c875c4ed9c93b1a7e4381b4891775d102ae3038f11ff684bf3345332332d846","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.16/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.16\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-16:euclid-6-14:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-16.proof.3","euclid-6-16.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-14","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"VI. 14"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-17:euclid-6-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-17.proof.2","euclid-6-17.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"VI. 16"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-28:euclid-6-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-28","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-28.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.28","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.28/","sourceLabel":"VI. 16"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-32:euclid-6-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-32.conclusion"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus